---

<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-heading">
  <div class="profile-intro">
    <div class="profile-copy">
      <h1 id="intro-heading">
        Hi, I’m Ciarán&nbsp;
        <span class="wave" aria-hidden="true">
          👋
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="pronunciation">Pronounced “KEER-awn”</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>
    I’m a principal machine learning engineer focused on building machine
    learning systems that solve complex, real-world problems.
  </p>

  <p>
    I enjoy turning challenging ideas into useful products and exploring
    practical applications of emerging technologies.
  </p>

  <p class="page-actions">
    <a class="icon-button" href="/resume/">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8zm0 1.5L19.5 9H14zM8 13h8v1.5H8zm0 3h8v1.5H8zm0-6h4v1.5H8z"></path>
      </svg>
      Resume
    </a>
  </p>
</section>
